Jemkor's Comic: Issue IV       NannyMUD Times                        Page 12

  Due to a suggestion received from the almighty God, our character Bayar 
  changed his name to Jemkor, to better fit in the community.

                           *       *       *                              
  
    Last we saw him, Jemkor has bought a Book of Quests. Since then, he 
    managed to solve the first 5 quests. But now, it is time to go on a 
    little treasure hunt. 
    
    Will he find a rare object for the recycler of things?
  

  __The Scavenger____________________________________________________________

  Jemkor: Well, the first quests were fairly easy. Now for the sixth one.
    A rare object... time to get started!

  One hour later...

  Jemkor: I think I have found enough stuff. Let's go to Elfwood village!
  
  Elfwood - Recycler of things

  Jemkor: Here you go, old man, all the treasures of the world in this pack.

  Old elf: Im an elf. 
           Whatever, lets see here... this stuff is no treasure!
           
  Jemkor: What? You're joking! Just look carefully!
  
  Old elf: Fine.
           These bundles of paper... I have tons of them.
           This knife... worthless.
           This jacket is worthless.
           This small gem... I have no use of rocks.
           This towel... I have rags to last me a lifetime.

  Jemkor thinks ...ooo000 (That will end soon...)

  Jemkor: Fine, I'll search for something else...

  In a forest

  ...ooo000 (Wonder what can I bring to that guy to finish this quest.)
  
  A dying man: Please help me! Take this amulet to my master in Camelot 
               or the whole world will be doomed!
               
  Jemkor: I don't have time for this. 
          <puts an amulet in a backpack>
          
  Jemkor: Ah! I know! I'll raid the goblin caves... again.
 
  One hour later in Elfwood
 
  Jemkor:Here you go! Fine treasure of Nanny !

  Old elf sighs.
  Old elf: Wery well... 
           worthless junk... 
           knives... 
           goblin body parts...

  Jemkor: And don't forget about the gold coins.

  Old elf: I dont take bribes... oh wait! WAIT!!! WHAT IS THIS?!?

  Jemkor: Dunno, I don't remember picking that up... you can have it 
          if you want.
          
  Old elf takes an amulet and gives Jemkor 124 gold coins and 4 questpoints.

  Jemkor: Thanks.

  In a forest near Camelot

  Jemkor: I'm glad I managed to do this quest. But I still dont remember 
          picking that amulet, but I think it is not important.
          
  As Jemkor is slowly strolling north, Camelot is engulfed by fire.

  Jemkor: Yes, I'm sure it is not important.
